Title: Chapter 2: The Scroll That Doesn't Change
Creation-Date: 2026-07-03
Last-Modified: 2026-10-04
Output-Formats:
Tagline: Neural network weights are lossy compression and always will be. The solution is the same one every literate civilization discovered: write it down. Plus: the industry starts stripping facts out of the weights on purpose, stumbles within one step of this book's thesis, and does not notice that the harness it needs was built by humans three thousand years ago.
